OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786879093
OL,3,CFamily warn of rare condition NF2
OL,4,Cafter daughter's devastating diagnosis
OL,6,FGranada Reports correspondent Ann
OL,7,FO'Connor spoke to Evelyn Nutter and
OL,8,Fher family about her rare diagnosis
OL,10,FA family from Manchester is warning
OL,11,Fparents about a rare condition they
OL,12,Fdiscovered their daughter had on the
OL,13,Ffirst day of her school summer
OL,14,Fholidays.
OL,16,FEvelyn Nutter won't return to school
OL,17,Fin Worsley in September because she
OL,18,Fhas to have surgery to remove a tumour
OL,19,Ffrom her brain that has drastically
OL,20,Faffected her hearing.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
