CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786879093
OL,3,CFamily warn of rare condition NF2
OL,4,Cafter daughter's devastating diagnosis
OL,6,FHer parents say that when Evelyn was
OL,7,Fgrowing up, doctors noticed she had a
OL,8,Fsquint and her eye was sometimes
OL,9,Fslightly turned, but tests revealed
OL,10,Fnothing concerning.
OL,12,FIt was only recently they noticed her
OL,13,Fhearing was reduced, and she was sent
OL,14,Ffor scans of her brain, which revealed
OL,15,Fa tumour.
OL,17,FEvelyn's mum Emma Thompson-Nutter
OL,18,Fsaid: "Little did we know this was
OL,19,Fgoing on in her body. But until a few
OL,20,Fweeks ago, we didn't know what NF2
OL,21,Fwas."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
