FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786879093
OL,3,CFamily warn of rare condition NF2
OL,4,Cafter daughter's devastating diagnosis
OL,6,FNF2 is a rare condition which sees
OL,7,Ftumours develop in the brain and
OL,8,Fspinal chord which will hamper sight,
OL,9,Fspeech and movement. The tumour is not
OL,10,Fcancerous, but surgery to remove it
OL,11,Fwill mean Evelyn will lose hearing in
OL,12,Fher right ear.
OL,14,FDr Grace Vassallo from Royal
OL,15,FManchester Children's Hospital said:
OL,16,F"It is a very rare disease and unless
OL,17,Fa doctor thinks about it, they are
OL,18,Fnever going to diagnose it.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1786879093
OL,3,CFamily warn of rare condition NF2
OL,4,Cafter daughter's devastating diagnosis
OL,6,F"It can present differently in
OL,7,Fchildren to adults. So we have to be
OL,8,Fmore alert and more aware."
OL,10,FEvelyn family want others to be aware
OL,11,Fof the signs and symptoms, but also to
OL,12,Ftry to raise cash for research and
OL,13,Ftreatment.
OL,15,FEmma said: "We want people to know
OL,16,Fabout this, we want people to be
OL,17,Freading about it."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/4
